#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:5
#: f4a12e522a6b46e5bca2c2d83fcb47dd
msgid "Setup Eclipse on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上配置 Eclipse"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:7
#: ec67d56343c64bc880dc513c45d108e0
msgid ""
"This page shows how to setup Eclipse on Windows to build using waf which "
"allows building for all supported boards."
msgstr "本页说明如何在 Windows 上配置 Eclipse，以使用 waf 构建（支持所有受支持的飞控板）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:11
#: ad163dd681134357b2017dcfb924afa9
msgid ""
"These instructions assume you have already :ref:`Setup the Build Environment"
" on Windows using Cygwin <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"
msgstr ""
"本指南假设您已完成 :ref:`使用 Cygwin 配置 Windows 构建环境 <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:14
#: 293878618b1242d98e9b4b6c30c8c8c5
msgid "Remove Pixhawk Toolchain (if present)"
msgstr "移除 Pixhawk 工具链（如已安装）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:16
#: d4598adb66524453820b3184fbc5df9c
msgid ""
"If you have been using the :ref:`older method which relied on Make "
"<building-px4-with-make>` first remove the old tool chain by renaming the "
"``C:\\pixhawk_toolchain`` directory to ``C:\\pixhawk_toolchain.bak``"
msgstr ""
"如果您曾使用 :ref:`依赖 Make 的旧方法 <building-px4-with-make>`，请先通过将 "
"``C:\\pixhawk_toolchain`` 目录重命名为 ``C:\\pixhawk_toolchain.bak`` 来移除旧工具链"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:19
#: a540b912e4c144b582778a64dd6ff8cd
msgid "Install and Run Eclipse"
msgstr "安装并运行 Eclipse"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:21
#: 40a48b48f07b4fd88c52999e723218d7
msgid ""
"Download `Eclipse 64 bit from here <https://www.eclipse.org/downloads/>`__"
msgstr "从 `此处下载 Eclipse 64 位版本 <https://www.eclipse.org/downloads/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:22
#: e10b31a340f54170b8959cde3fe09c2d
msgid ""
"Run the downloaded eclipse installer and select \"Eclipse IDE for C/C++ "
"Developers\""
msgstr "运行下载的 Eclipse 安装程序，选择「Eclipse IDE for C/C++ Developers」"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:23
#: f7a4accf3f874a98a6074131d2df7694
msgid "Accept the Eclipse Foundation certificate when asked"
msgstr "在提示时接受 Eclipse Foundation 证书"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:24
#: 79e34c0d77e74a7683108b2e35171176
msgid "Launch Eclipse and click on the \"Workbench\" button on the top right"
msgstr "启动 Eclipse，点击右上角的「Workbench」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:27
#: 521610d7b62140aab50996e663862f8c
msgid "Import ArduPilot"
msgstr "导入 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:29
#: 6547bdfe5caf4c00b630db5a4d67f7b4
msgid "Once Eclipse has been started import ArduPilot by doing the following:"
msgstr "启动 Eclipse 后，按如下步骤导入 ArduPilot："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:31
#: a0ecede76ac04aa4a06cf18da830dc01
msgid "Select File, New, Makefile Project with Existing Code"
msgstr ""
"选择 File（文件）→ New（新建）→ Makefile Project with Existing Code（基于现有代码的 Makefile "
"项目）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:37
#: 546ed6f64722449b81105525a34db1ba
msgid ""
"When the \"New Project\" window appears select the folder into which "
"ardupilot was :ref:`cloned <git-clone>` and select the Toolchain to be "
"\"Cygwin GCC\""
msgstr ""
"当「New Project」窗口出现时，选择 ardupilot :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` "
"所在的文件夹，并将工具链设置为「Cygwin GCC」"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:43
#: d3bf7ea68e0e4dcc84ea2fa4ce7826ca
msgid ""
"In the Project Explorer tab on the top right, right-mouse-button-click on "
"the \"ardupilot\" folder and select \"Properties\""
msgstr "在右上角的「Project Explorer」选项卡中，右键单击「ardupilot」文件夹，选择「Properties」（属性）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:44
#: 7c127612f68a4ca697da5d2f15b55572
msgid ""
"When the \"Properties for ardupilot\" window appears, under \"C/C++ Build\","
" uncheck \"Use default build command\" and enter "
"``c:\\cygwin64\\bin\\python3.7m`` into the \"Build command\" field as shown "
"below"
msgstr ""
"当「Properties for ardupilot」窗口出现时，在「C/C++ Build」下取消选中「Use default build "
"command」，然后在「Build command」字段中输入 ``c:\\cygwin64\\bin\\python3.7m`` （如下图所示）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:50
#: c05b9061294e4374b3a1a0182a8293a4
msgid ""
"Click the \"Behavior\" tab, select \"Use custom build arguments\" enter "
"``waf``. Additional arguments such as ``-j 16`` may be added here. The "
"argument ``-j 16`` configures Cygwin to use 16 logical processors of the 8 "
"core machine in this example."
msgstr ""
"点击「Behavior」选项卡，选择「Use custom build arguments」，输入 ``waf``。此处还可以添加额外参数，例如 "
"``-j 16``。参数 ``-j 16`` 将 Cygwin 配置为在本例中使用 8 核机器的 16 个逻辑处理器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:51
#: 98d7dbebb47c42aea3e07a9bf12aa464
msgid ""
"Setting \"Workbench Build Behavior\" will allow the use of built-in buttons "
"for clean and build all targets. Note if you prefer to only build for a "
"single vehicle type using these buttons change \"build\" to \"copter\"."
msgstr ""
"设置「Workbench Build "
"Behavior」后，可使用内置按钮进行清理和全量构建。注意：如果您希望通过这些按钮仅针对单一车辆类型进行构建，请将「build」改为「copter」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:58
#: 6ec9e07e581e4450b1518cc5d9959165
msgid "Setup Build Target"
msgstr "设置构建目标"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:60
#: 7a66f126bfe14b96bf3b6bc41a10d2e8
msgid ""
"Within the \"Build Targets\" tab on the right select \"ardupilot\" and push "
"the green \"New Build Target\" button."
msgstr "在右侧「Build Targets」选项卡中，选中「ardupilot」，然后点击绿色「New Build Target」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:61
#: a74dccc26ed44f5486797d1c339a844a
msgid ""
"In the \"Target name\" field enter ``configure --board fmuv3 --no-submodule-"
"update`` and press OK to create a build target to configure the waf build "
"for Pixhawk/Cube flight controllers using ChibiOS"
msgstr ""
"在「Target name」字段中输入 ``configure --board fmuv3 --no-submodule-update``，然后按 OK"
" 创建一个构建目标，用于为使用 ChibiOS 的 Pixhawk/Cube 飞控配置 waf 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:62
#: 7eeb7140552f4c4ca14a9205356e502a
msgid "Create another build target called ``copter``"
msgstr "再创建一个名为 ``copter`` 的构建目标"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:63
#: a2e052f576554c2089ec049009870cd3
msgid ""
"Run these two targets in order to create an ArduPilot Copter binary for "
"Pixhawk/Cube flight controllers"
msgstr "依次运行这两个目标，为 Pixhawk/Cube 飞控创建 ArduPilot Copter 二进制文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:64
#: f1ae55aff0174a43b41da83106451110
msgid ""
"If the build fails with a \"Missing configuration file\" check the ardupilot"
" directory for a directory called \"build\" and delete it and try again"
msgstr ""
"如果构建失败并提示「Missing configuration file」，请检查 ardupilot "
"目录中是否存在「build」目录，若有则删除后重试"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:65
#: 3e83fd49527e45d89c79a112c878ea57
msgid ""
"Other useful build targets include, ``clean``, ``plane``, ``rover`` and  "
"``--help``"
msgstr "其他常用构建目标包括：``clean``、``plane``、``rover`` 和 ``--help``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:67
#: e07c9806980b4599aa26e162a41bb99a
msgid ""
"The arducopter.apj firmware will be created in the "
"**ardupilot\\\\build\\\\fmuv3\\\\bin** directory and can be uploaded from "
"the Mission Planner or other ground station."
msgstr ""
"arducopter.apj 固件将在 **ardupilot\\\\build\\\\fmuv3\\\\bin** 目录中生成，可通过 Mission"
" Planner 或其他地面站上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:75
#: 0f03070664c4404890f79897e64ebe6d
msgid ""
"The ``configure`` build target described above requires the ``--no-"
"submodule-update`` be prepended because the submodule update step of the "
"build does not yet work with the setup described here.  We expect this to be"
" resolved in the future but until then, please open a **git bash** terminal "
"and run ``git submodule update --recursive`` if you believe the submodules "
"have been updated recently."
msgstr ""
"上述 ``configure`` 构建目标需要在前面加上 ``--no-submodule-"
"update``，因为此处描述的配置中，构建的子模块更新步骤尚不能正常工作。我们期望未来解决此问题，在此之前，如果您认为子模块最近已更新，请打开 "
"**git bash** 终端并运行 ``git submodule update --recursive``。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:78
#: dbbe11bbedb1461fb58eaab3b170d9b8
msgid "Use spaces instead of tabs"
msgstr "使用空格代替制表符"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:80
#: 19031974dab34be5b43cd1eae62542fa
msgid ""
"By default Copter, Plane and Rover use spaces in place of tabs. This can be "
"set to the default in Eclipse by changing two settings"
msgstr "默认情况下，Copter、Plane 和 Rover 使用空格代替制表符。可以通过更改 Eclipse 中的两项设置将其设为默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:82
#: 8bbaae457f5f467b9c3e74e43aa063ba
msgid ""
"Select **Window \\| Preferences \\| General \\| Editors \\| Text Editors \\|"
" Insert spaces for tabs**."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Window \\| Preferences \\| General \\| Editors \\| Text Editors \\| "
"Insert spaces for tabs**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-windows-eclipse.rst:88
#: e58050164c4448a4b544f9acd8a2f9be
msgid ""
"Select **Windows \\| Preferences \\| C/C++ \\| Code Style \\| Formatter** "
"and creating a new Profile (i.e. \"K&R Tab\") which has the \"Indentation\" "
"set to \"Spaces only\""
msgstr ""
"选择 **Windows \\| Preferences \\| C/C++ \\| Code Style \\| "
"Formatter**，创建一个新的代码格式配置（例如「K&R Tab」），并将「Indentation」设置为「Spaces only」"
